 - Contributors may only modify tasks assigned to themselves, and may not reassign tasks. Managers may modify any task.
 - Only managers may delete tasks.
 - Archived projects reject all writes with 409 (reads still work).
+- Freezing a project (`POST /projects/{pid}/freeze`) needs the `manager` role (other readers get 403, non-members 404, archived projects 409). It changes every member's role to `viewer`, managers included, and clears the assignee of every task in the project, because an assignee must be a contributor or manager. A frozen project therefore accepts no task writes (403). There is no unfreeze endpoint.
